  "reason": "RNA-only PCA is currently much stronger than image-only ResNet, but only one RNA encoder has been tested. This experiment tests whether a learned RNA representation (scvi_n200) improves over PCA while keeping model setting, profile setting, and aggregation fixed, cleanly isolating the effect of representation. That information is important before adding multiprofile aggregation or multimodal fusion, because it will determine whether later experiments should build on PCA or a learned RNA encoder."
